* sg13g2-lc-pll :: sim/cp-dc -- charge-pump static current bench.
* ONE .dc sweep of the output voltage, typical corner, nominal 3.3 V supply, 27 C.
* Two copies of the same cp subcircuit share the sweep: copy A has UP forced on and DN
* off (its output current is I_up), copy B has DN forced on and UP off (I_dn). The B
* output follows the A output through a unity VCVS, so both see the same V_out at every
* point. Each copy has its own IREF = 20 uA source. Placeholders (@@...@@) are filled by
* scripts/run-cp-dc.sh; nothing else is substituted.
.lib @@MODELS_DIR@@/cornerMOShv.lib mos_tt
.option scale=1 temp=27
.include @@CP_NETLIST@@

VDD vdd 0 3.3
VHI hi 0 3.3
VA outa 0 2.0
EB nb 0 outa 0 1
VMB nb outb 0
IRA vdd irefa dc 20u
IRB vdd irefb dc 20u
XA hi 0 irefa outa vdd 0 cp
XB 0 hi irefb outb vdd 0 cp

.dc VA 1.0 3.3 0.05

.control
pre_osdi @@OSDI_PSP@@
run
* i(VA): current into the + node of VA = sourced by copy A (I_up).
* i(VMB): current from nb into outb = sunk by copy B (I_dn).
wrdata @@DATA_OUT@@ i(VA) i(VMB)
.endc
.end
